      "src": 5,
      "text": "Reviewer found the recording sounds very good, better than the description led them to expect, given the recording conditions",
      "type": "sound"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 6,
      "text": "Reviewer describes a taping trick at the race track: skull-topped pole with mics in the eye sockets, decorated with beads and flags",
      "type": "scene"
     },
     {
      "recording": "deadco2023-05-06.mk41v.flac24",
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 7,
      "text": "Reviewer calls it a fine recording given festival circumstances, and was pleasantly surprised by it",
      "type": "sound"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 7,
      "text": "Reviewer says many listeners criticize this show, but the band still jammed and it was fun to hear",
      "type": "compare"
     },
     {
      "recording": "deadco2023-05-06.mk41v.flac24",
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 1,
      "text": "Schoeps mk41v mics in ORTF, 6.5 feet high near the soundboard, through Naiant PFA preamps to a MixPre 6 II at 32-bit/44.1",
      "type": "lineage"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 1,
      "text": "Taper's gear was soaked for hours by rain; mics went up only minutes before the band started, and wind is strong early on",
      "type": "scene"
     },
     {
      "recording": "deadco2023-05-06.mk41v.flac24",
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 1,
      "text": "Described as a warts-and-all tape, with stout wind throughout, especially heavy until Brown Eyed Women",
      "type": "sound"
     },
     {
      "recording": "deadco2023-05-06.lineaudiocm3.oadedr100",
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 2,
      "text": "Rain and gusts cause wind noise and phasey treble; nearby chatty crowd conversation is audible throughout",
      "type": "sound"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 2,
      "text": "North Side Skull and Bones Gang made a special appearance during the show",
      "type": "scene"
     },
     {
      "recording": "deadco2023-05-06",
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 3,
      "text": "Recorded on a Shure MV88 mic into an iPhone 7 with Motiv app, converted to 24/48 FLAC",
      "type": "lineage"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 3,
      "text": "Set ran 4:30pm to 7pm on the Festival Stage; lineup included Weir, Mayer, Burbridge, Chimenti and Jay Lane",
      "type": "scene"
     },
     {
      "recording": null,
      "song": null,
      "song_key": null,
      "src": 3,
      "text": "Recording begins at 5:49pm, missing about the first 80 minutes, because the taper stayed to watch Dee Dee Bridgewater",
      "type": "scene"
     }
    ],
